  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMistyStep0]{Misty Step} without expending a spell slot. You can do so a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest. In addition, whenever you cast Misty Step, you can bring along one willing creature you can see within 5 feet of you; it teleports to an unoccupied space of your choice within 5 feet of your destination space.</p>",
